    <rdfs:label>Bookkeeping, Accounting, and Auditing Clerks</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:Net_job_titles>Sample of reported job titles: Account Clerk, Accounting Assistant, Accounting Associate, Accounting Clerk, Accounting Specialist, Accounting Technician, Accounts Payable Clerk, Accounts Payable Specialist, Accounts Payables Clerk, Accounts Receivable Clerk</ns5:Net_job_titles>
    <ns5:Net_short_description>Compute, classify, and record numerical data to keep financial records complete. Perform any combination of routine calculating, posting, and verifying duties to obtain primary financial data for use in maintaining accounting records. May also check the accuracy of figures, calculations, and postings pertaining to business transactions recorded by other workers.</ns5:Net_short_description>
  </rdf:Description>
