    <ns3:descrizioneITA>------ Non disponibile ------</ns3:descrizioneITA>
    <ns3:description>Functions associated with frequency, fluency and complexity of total and individual body-part movements such as infant spontaneous movements and patterns of movement. Note: this code should be applied only to infants aged less than corrected age 6 months.
Exclusions: motor reflex functions (b750); involuntary movement reaction functions (b755); involuntary movement functions (b765)</ns3:description>
