  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#b770">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/RientraOnt3Merged#Low_Back_Pain"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Body_functions"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/RientraOnt3Merged#Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Spinal_Cord_Injury"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Stroke"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Traumatic_Brain_Injury"/>
    <rdfs:label>Gait pattern functions</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#b770"/>
    <ns3:description>Functions of movement patterns associated with walking, running or other whole body movements.
Inclusions: walking patterns and running patterns; impairments such as spastic gait, hemiplegic gait, paraplegic gait, asymmetric gait, limping and stiff gait pattern
Exclusions: muscle power functions (b730); muscle tone functions (b735); control of voluntary movement functions (b760); involuntary movement functions (b765)</ns3:description>
    <ns3:descrizioneITA>Funzioni di pattern di movimento associati al camminare, correre o ad altri movimenti di tutto il corpo.

Inclusioni: pattern della deambulazione e della corsa; menomazioni come pattern dellâ€™andatura spastica, emiplegica, paraplegica, asimmetrica, zoppicante e rigida

Esclusione: funzioni della forza muscolare (b730); funzioni del tono muscolare (b735); funzioni di controllo del movimento volontario (b760); funzioni del movimento involontario (b765)</ns3:descrizioneITA>
    <ns3:nomeIta>Funzioni del pattern dellâ€™andatura</ns3:nomeIta>
  </rdf:Description>
