  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#d445">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Traumatic_Brain_Injury"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Vocational_Rehabilitation"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Activities_and_participation"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/RientraOnt3Merged#Low_Back_Pain"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/RientraOnt3Merged#Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Stroke"/>
    <ns3:nomeIta>Uso della mano e del braccio</ns3:nomeIta>
    <ns3:descrizioneITA>Compiere le azioni coordinate necessarie per muovere o manipolare oggetti usando mani e braccia, come nel girare le maniglie della porta o nel tirare o afferrare un oggetto.

Inclusioni: tirare o spingere oggetti; raggiungere allungando il braccio; girare o esercitare torsione delle mani o delle braccia; lanciare; afferrare

Esclusione: uso fine della mano (d440)</ns3:descrizioneITA>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#d445"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Hand and arm use</rdfs:label>
    <ns3:description xml:lang="en">Performing the coordinated actions required to move objects or to manipulate them by using hands and arms, such as when turning door handles or throwing or catching an object.

Inclusions: pulling or pushing objects; reaching; turning or twisting the hands or arms; throwing; catching

Exclusions: fine hand use (d440)</ns3:description>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#d740">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/RientraOnt3Merged#Hand_Conditions"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Traumatic_Brain_Injury"/>
