    <ns3:description xml:lang="en">Raising up an object or taking something from one place to another, such as when lifting a cup or toy or carrying a box, or a child from one room to another.

Inclusions: lifting, carrying in the hands or arms, or on shoulders, hip, back, or head; putting down</ns3:description>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#d430"/>
