    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/RientraOnt3Merged#Hearing_Loss"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Vocational_Rehabilitation"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Activities_and_participation"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Stroke"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Traumatic_Brain_Injury"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#d175"/>
    <rdfs:label>Solving problems</rdfs:label>
    <ns3:description xml:lang="en">Finding solutions to questions or situations by identifying and analysing issues, developing options and solutions, evaluating potential effects of solutions, and executing a chosen solution, such as in resolving a dispute between two people.

Inclusions: solving simple and complex problems

Exclusions: thinking (d163); making decisions (d177)</ns3:description>
    <ns3:nomeIta>Risoluzione di problemi</ns3:nomeIta>
    <ns3:descrizioneITA>Trovare soluzioni a problemi o situazioni identificando e analizzando le questioni, sviluppando opzioni e soluzioni, valutandone i potenziali effetti e mettendo in atto la soluzione prescelta, come nel risolvere una disputa fra due persone.

Inclusioni: risoluzione di problemi semplici e complessi

Esclusioni: pensiero (d163); prendere decisioni (d177)</ns3:descrizioneITA>
  </rdf:Description>
