  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#d460">
    <rdfs:label>Moving around in different locations</rdfs:label>
    <ns3:descrizioneITA>Camminare e spostarsi in vari posti e situazioni, come camminare attraverso le stanze di una casa, allâ€™interno di un palazzo o per la strada in cittÃ .

Inclusioni: spostarsi allâ€™interno della casa, strisciare o salire allâ€™interno della casa; camminare o muoversi allâ€™interno di edifici diversi da casa propria e al di fuori di casa e di altri edifici</ns3:descrizioneITA>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/RientraOnt3Merged#Low_Back_Pain"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/RientraOnt3Merged#Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Activities_and_participation"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Stroke"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#d460"/>
    <ns3:description xml:lang="en">Walking and moving around in various places and situations, such as walking between rooms in a house, within a building, or down the street of a town.

Inclusions: moving around within the home, crawling or climbing within the home; walking or moving within buildings other than the home, and outside the home and other buildings</ns3:description>
    <ns3:nomeIta>Spostarsi in diverse collocazioni</ns3:nomeIta>
  </rdf:Description>
