    <ns5:Net_job_titles>Sample of reported job titles: Clerk Specialist, Clerk Typist, Keyboard Specialist, Management Services Technician, Office Technician, Principal Clerk Typist, Project Assistant, Stenographer, Typist, Word Processor</ns5:Net_job_titles>
